{"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "query": "Unit tests for an Arduino Uno module: Pet feeding timer: two interrupt buttons, status LEDs and a 16x2 LCD. Pins: pin 2 INPUT_PULLUP feeding button to GND, interrupt on FALLING (not connected in the test setup: reads HIGH); pin 3 INPUT_PULLUP screen button to GND, interrupt on FALLING (not connected: reads HIGH); pin 14 OUTPUT green LED (A0); pin 15 OUTPUT yellow LED (A1); pin 16 OUTPUT red LED (A2); pin 10 OUTPUT LCD backlight switch; pin 4 OUTPUT LCD 16x2 RS (E 5, D4..D7 = 6..9). Arduino API used: attachInterrupt, digitalPinToInterrupt, digitalWrite, interrupts, millis, pinMode. Libraries: LiquidCrystal. Library API used: begin, setCursor. Simulated devices: none. Functions to test: void pet_reset_state(), void pet_init(), void pet_loop(), void pet_loop_at(unsigned long currentTime), void resetTime(), void resetTimeAt(unsigned long now), void screenON(), void screenONAt(unsigned long now), void displayFeedingInfo(unsigned long deltaTime, unsigned long currentTime), void ledFeedingStatus(unsigned long deltaTime), const char *pet_lcd_line(uint8_t row).", "embedding": [-0.059967041015625, -0.03131103515625, -0.003925323486328125, -0.0248870849609375, -0.0250091552734375, 0.01392364501953125, 0.0172576904296875, 0.020263671875, 0.03472900390625, 0.00951385498046875, 0.038909912109375, -0.04779052734375, -0.0201263427734375, 0.0216217041015625, 0.010650634765625, -0.00865936279296875, 0.01435089111328125, 0.018646240234375, -0.051910400390625, 0.055511474609375, 0.020965576171875, -0.01250457763671875, 0.041748046875, -0.00214385986328125, 0.00339508056640625, -0.0821533203125, 0.030975341796875, 0.01399993896484375, 0.033111572265625, -0.015899658203125, 0.0141448974609375, -0.021636962890625, -0.0220489501953125, -0.0259246826171875, -0.00237274169921875, 0.032440185546875, 0.01337432861328125, -0.00118255615234375, -0.0261688232421875, -0.0290679931640625, -0.053955078125, -0.0411376953125, 0.0146026611328125, -0.0257873